# File: hooks/register.test.ts
# Generated from: specs/574-controller-stalls-waiting-on-a-finished-worker-s-background-commands/requirements.md
Feature: Controller stalls waiting on a finished worker's background commands

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: A finished worker's exited background commands do not block routing
    Given a stage worker that backgrounded a Bash command which then exited
    And the worker has written its handoff and settled
    When the engine reports the worker's stop with no in-flight background tasks
    Then the worker's tracked background list is empty
    And the controller routes the next step without the worker taking another turn

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: A still-running background command still blocks
    Given a settled stage worker whose backgrounded Bash command the engine still lists as running
    When the controller waits for that stage
    Then it keeps waiting
    And it routes the next step only after a later stop event no longer lists the command
